    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness emerges, unearthly creatures invade the land. Allegiance is demanded under the threat of consumption. Those that join are transformed into the monsters they fear. Whispers of the source of the Vinegar Mutter have emerged. Cymon an old, but powerful wizard, knows something must be done to find the root of this curse. He seeks out his brother Edgar for guidance, and assistance, hoping he's still alive. He must solve the mystery of what allowed the creatures to come into this world, and stop their reign of terror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747180/extras/b9af66f9ca6dc83f72b2f339c566838e.poster.avif?t=1754884112\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747180/extras/b9af66f9ca6dc83f72b2f339c566838e.webm?t=1754884112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747180/extras/b9af66f9ca6dc83f72b2f339c566838e.mp4?t=1754884112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through 8 levels in this fast paced retro shooter, finding new spells, overcoming deadly obstacles, and battling your way through many types of unearthly creatures, trying to stop you from finding the source of it all... The Vinegar Mutter. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cymon travels from kingdom to kingdom, looking for his brother he hasn't heard from since the curse came upon the world, trying to learn more about the source of the evil, and ways to eventually stop it. The origin of this madness provides many surprises along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your magic with the help of the new staffs you collect on your journey. Each provide a unique form of devastation. Utilize them to lay waste to all of the creatures who dare to try to consume you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freedom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to bring normalcy back to the world, remove the curse that plagues it, and allow your kind to once again reign free.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience horrific sound effects, and haunting music, that will fill your soul with terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747180/extras/d1a8e3199e89bd0d8a705dec56001eb1.poster.avif?t=1754884112\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747180/extras/d1a8e3199e89bd0d8a705dec56001eb1.webm?t=1754884112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747180/extras/d1a8e3199e89bd0d8a705dec56001eb1.mp4?t=1754884112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
