lp of the new staffs you collect on your journey. Each provide a unique form of devastation. Utilize them to lay waste to all of the creatures who dare to try to consume you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freedom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to bring normalcy back to the world, remove the curse that plagues it, and allow your kind to once again reign free.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience horrific sound effects, and haunting music, that will fill your soul with terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747180/extras/d1a8e3199e89bd0d8a705dec56001eb1.poster.avif?t=1754884112\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747180/extras/d1a8e3199e89bd0d8a705dec56001eb1.webm?t=1754884112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747180/extras/d1a8e3199e89bd0d8a705dec56001eb1.mp4?t=1754884112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
